Bastions

Dragon packs now have Leaders. Dragon Leaders can capture Bastions.
The capture of the Bastion will take place during the time period set by the owner.


Guilds

Added "Guilds" information window. It is available to captains without a guild. The following information is available in the window:
Guild name;
Description of the guild;
The number of members in the guild;
The number of occupied territories;
A button that enables you to write and send a telegram to the Guild Master.

Ship Modules

Ship modules, Module production skills, and new books have been added to the World on the Edge of the Inside Out.

Currently, 5 types of modules are known:

Power module;
Carrying capacity module;
Strength module;
Altitude module;
Manoeuvrability module.


All modules have two characteristics. The first characteristic is assigned based on the type of module, and the second is calculated randomly.

The first characteristic improves one of the stats of the ship, and the second one reduces any other stat.

To increase the first characteristic or decrease the second, you can learn new module production skills.

Modules are produced in the Engineering bureaus of Castles.

Ships

To make the ships, which carry a big number of strekolets, more effective:
the hangars of warships Paladin and Mammoth was expanded to 25 strekolets;
the carrying capacity of the human warship Paladin was increased to 340,000;
the carrying capacity of the orc warship Mammoth was increased to 360,000;

Ammunition

The space taken up by a torpedo in holds and warehouses was decreased.

Event

The NPC cities of the world stopped to buy Snowmen and Snowflakes.
Snowmen and Snowflakes were removed from the property of the players.

