Market:
Telegrams were introduced to the game. Your character will receive a telegram when:

creating a lot for purchase;
removing a lot for purchase;
creating a lot for sale;
removing a lot for sale.

Errors:

The bug which caused the crash of the client while removing a sapphire from a strekolet to the ship hull was fixed. 
Calculation of statistics of “Traveled By Strekolet” was corrected.

