Captains!
New update V0.1.49 is up
Changes in game mechanics:

The map of the game’s world has been expanded by 100 miles to the North and 100 miles to the East; 
16 new NPC cities have been added: 8 Empire cities and 8 Alliance cities, including human capital Beregor and orc capital Nargval
Initial speed of 10 lb and 37 lb projectiles has been reduced;
 5 new consumer goods have been added, they are produced in the new cities: volcanic mud, quartz, granite, volcanic tuff, volcanic foam;
Increased cost for making second and next characters;
Volume of the sound of shooting has been adjusted;
You can no longer create buy/sell lots for livre and soll (silver and copper coins), you can no longer buy these currencies;
We have removed the part of the menu, which shows how many silver and copper coins you have. If some players still have them, these currencies will be automatically converted to gold some time later;
You can now buy sapphires to Gnome City In the capitals of Alliance and Empire;
Special settlement ”Hidden base” is temporarily removed in order to make some changes; 
A character, flying on Dragon Wings, will have the option of being instantly transported to the nearest place with his or her property. Price – 1 gold for 1 mile.
A new skill called “Planner” has been introduced, which allows the player to have a different number of settlements under his or her control.
The skill has 15 levels. The first level of the skill allows the player to build 1 settlement.  Level 15 allows the player to build 15 settlements. Therefore, one character can have a limited maximum number of settlements – 15. 
For players who have more than 15 settlements (at the moment of the introduction of this new update): in case they decide to destroy a settlement, they will not be able to build a new one.

Other minor improvements.
The update went live on November 10 2016 at 16:00 (UTC+0)
Thank you, captains!

