Captains! The new Update V0.1.47 is up!

Changes in the game mechanics:

From now on you get reputation points for destroying pirate ships (pirates with negative reputation in your race) in the support zone;
You cannot capture NPC/someone else’s ship when piloting a strekolet which isn’t yours. The strekolet must be bought or built by yourself in your own settlement;
Some skills are temporarily unavailable for learning by new players. We have decided to alter and improve them. These skills are: “Mentor”, “Charisma”, “Misdirection”, “Distraction of the dragon”, “Summon of the dragon”, “The level of the dragon”, “Dragon Master”, “Dragons brood”, “Clone”. Those players who have already learned the aforementioned skills will not lose anything. 
You can now select Spanish UI (User Interface).


Fixed:

When the joint window of a building’s warehouse and the Flight Center’s warehouse is opened (by pressing “Shift+L”), the enhancers move correctly between them; 
Fixed the placement of the crystals, containers and other unique items in the settlements’ warehouses;
Ship building time now displays correctly in the Castle.


The update went live on October 13th 2016 at 12:40 (UTC+0)

Thank you, captains!

