Captains! 
The new Update v0.1.46 is up

Changes and bug fixes:

Castles look completely different now;
With a few exceptions most of castle’s buildings have 36 slots in the warehouse;
Holding capacity of the slots in the warehouses of castle’s buildings has been increased;
Lvl 1 castle’s buildings have 2 enhancer slots;
It costs more now to force skills to get learnt instantly;
The bug of a governor not being able to see the non-grata tick box beside the player under that effect has been fixed;
The bug where a non-owner of the settlement would see construction time of a building as time left for its destruction has been fixed;
The bug, where after being given the permission clan members/friends couldn’t control anti-aircraft platforms in settlements of one another, has been fixed. They couldn’t do actions like changing weapons or loading ammunition. They can do this now;
The bug, where the “launch strekolets in the air from a remote settlement or a ship” button (in the property window) didn’t work, has been fixed.

Other minor improvements.
The update went live at 13:00 (UTC+0), October 5 2016
Thank you, captains!

